{"data": [{"article": {"title": "My favorite ChatGPT Dots use case"}, "author_id": "20173404", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:15:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121215491591033001"], "id": "2121215491591033001", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I’ve been working through my emails by voice with ChatGPT Dots while walking. Less mental clutter, clearer thinking, and some exercise along the way. Here’s what works for me and where I still see trade-offs.\n\n#ChatGPT #AIAgents #Productivity https://t.co/VqONOTaWCd", "url": "https://x.com/oktaydemir/status/2121215491591033001"}, {"article": {"title": "The KING of GEO: Fable 5.2 (This should be illegal)"}, "author_id": "1298240486273101827", "created_at": "2026-11-13T09:20:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121171415642616131"], "id": "2121171415642616131", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 1569, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "https://t.co/9XSHZ6Rqhh", "url": "https://x.com/NicholasDulait/status/2121171415642616131"}, {"author_id": "1612238947890888705", "created_at": "2026-11-13T06:27:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121127753890312600"], "id": "2121127753890312600", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1612238947890888705", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 44, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121127749989658984", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Announced on X, not in docs yet:\n- ChatGPT dots follow your own rules, like \"show me a draft before sending any email\"\n- Grok Bot on Mac can use Mail, Calendar, Notes and Messages\n- Muse can make phone calls for you (paid plans, US)\n\nPlus 9 new real projects people built.", "url": "https://x.com/QuietlyByG/status/2121127753890312600"}, {"article": {"title": "Grok Bot, Muse and dots shipped in 7 weeks. They made the same 3 bets."}, "author_id": "1902919415928328192", "created_at": "2026-11-13T04:13:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121094022139912590"], "id": "2121094022139912590", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 15, "impression_count": 3162, "like_count": 32, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 25, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Grok Bot, Muse and dots made the same three bets. None of them is about the model. https://t.co/IPkOe6TpJn", "url": "https://x.com/Ronny_MiniMax/status/2121094022139912590"}, {"article": {"title": "Want to Get Started With AI? Start by Creating a Folder"}, "author_id": "278315434", "created_at": "2026-11-13T03:18:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121080168785785302"], "id": "2121080168785785302", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 599, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Day 8 of No Breaks November starts Phase 2: working with clients and helping them take their first steps with AI. Step one is a folder.\n\nI'm also trying something new: a short video in the How to Set It Up section. https://t.co/R40n3LEOiz", "url": "https://x.com/JustDoinJD/status/2121080168785785302"}, {"article": {"title": "Nod: agent cá nhân mã nguồn mở của n8n, có máy riêng và hỏi trước khi làm thay bạn"}, "author_id": "34929174", "created_at": "2026-11-12T20:16:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120973926348337487"], "id": "2120973926348337487", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 892, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/ZzvieJLwtm", "url": "https://x.com/layatai/status/2120973926348337487"}, {"article": {"title": "全球 AI 实验室与 AI Agent 晨报 · 2026-11-12"}, "author_id": "1771228604300492800", "created_at": "2026-11-12T07:03:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120774461083279861"], "id": "2120774461083279861", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/D3hdvk2y8J", "url": "https://x.com/DukeHarewood/status/2120774461083279861"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120742088849731584", "3_2120742827588251648"]}, "author_id": "2113286176732016640", "created_at": "2026-11-12T05:03:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120744328972902435"], "id": "2120744328972902435", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "we are in the very early stage of AI adoption. &lt; 0.1% of people (early adopters) are using agents like @Muse  and @OpenAI dots, and agents have already surpassed human internet traffic. \n\nMost products don't need to be built for humans any more. Go headless. https://t.co/bkFhpIw0ac", "url": "https://x.com/iamcode_ai/status/2120744328972902435"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2120742088849731584", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW5jsZIbsAAR8HE.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2120742827588251648", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW5kXZJa8AAvyFw.jpg"}], "users": [{"id": "20173404", "name": "Oktay Demir", "username": "oktaydemir"}, {"id": "1298240486273101827", "name": "Nicholas Dulait", "username": "NicholasDulait"}, {"id": "1612238947890888705", "name": "Offscreen", "username": "QuietlyByG"}, {"id": "1902919415928328192", "name": "RonnyHe", "username": "Ronny_MiniMax"}, {"id": "278315434", "name": "Jonathan Dyer", "username": "JustDoinJD"}, {"id": "34929174", "name": "Tai L", "username": "layatai"}, {"id": "1771228604300492800", "name": "哈伍德公爵", "username": "DukeHarewood"}, {"id": "2113286176732016640", "name": "i am code", "username": "iamcode_ai"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2121215491591033001", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzovccrninb0hee89z2tq705pg70d", "oldest_id": "2120744328972902435", "result_count": 8}}